# "Into your graveyard": Hymn to Tourach makes Bot2 discard two Islands into Bot2's graveyard, which is not Bot1's. (Bot2 also discarded one to hand size at cleanup, hence three.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Moonshadow
Hymn to Tourach
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Moonshadow.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hymn to Tourach.Cast(Bot2)
[T4 Bot2.Upkeep]

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 3
Bot1.Battlefield.Moonshadow.Counters.MinusOneMinusOne = 6
